{"data": [{"author_id": "1727554261633187840", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:08:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118480670486122803"], "id": "2118480670486122803", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 以后这个叫“卧槽时刻”", "url": "https://x.com/ai_horn1/status/2118480670486122803"}, {"author_id": "1957843228842946566", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:53:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118386255847469056"], "id": "2118386255847469056", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 写信问功能，它按现有能力写好回复。这步我最近也在用，少一轮来回", "url": "https://x.com/lawson_ste3476/status/2118386255847469056"}, {"author_id": "2114733813662142464", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:49:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118385231589683558"], "id": "2118385231589683558", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 写信问功能，它按现成能力把回信拟好只等你点发送，这比再开一轮对话省事多了。", "url": "https://x.com/maiai_fun/status/2118385231589683558"}, {"author_id": "1751541757370843136", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:42:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118383359353352237"], "id": "2118383359353352237", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 哈哈，厉害了~      今天刚好用grok帮我写了几十封合作邮件~有些地方我还是微调了下", "url": "https://x.com/ethanwang_ai/status/2118383359353352237"}, {"author_id": "1992573103734652928", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:37:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118382232641663429"], "id": "2118382232641663429", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 这次省下的还不只是写邮件，是把“想加个功能”翻译成了现有功能的使用路径。发出去前再核对一下菜单名和版本，别让用户照着走，最后卡在“我怎么没有这个按钮” 😂", "url": "https://x.com/sahuaja3669/status/2118382232641663429"}, {"author_id": "3122661542", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:26:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118379441181409424"], "id": "2118379441181409424", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 370, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 这个很棒啊 我去逆向看看他们怎么做到的", "url": "https://x.com/yangyi/status/2118379441181409424"}, {"author_id": "1988851885118484480", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:21:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118378065336426614"], "id": "2118378065336426614", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 这 aha 瞬间我懂，Grok 居然知道产品现有功能，连回复都写好了。以后回邮件只剩点发送这一步，省下来的时间能干多少活啊。", "url": "https://x.com/taiyanghere/status/2118378065336426614"}, {"author_id": "26780664", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:20:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118377853242970531"], "id": "2118377853242970531", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 grok bot 确实有点东西，很难想象 AI 跟个人的信息打通后会多便利", "url": "https://x.com/rockeymen/status/2118377853242970531"}, {"author_id": "1572276696014782464", "created_at": "2026-11-05T16:16:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118376971516424306"], "id": "2118376971516424306", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6690032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118376478509617495", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vista8 哈哈这才是真·助理。能读懂产品功能直接起草回复，比只会「我帮你搜一下」强太多了。我们现在日常运营就靠这类 agent，关键还是你点发送前得自己扫一眼。", "url": "https://x.com/JY960516/status/2118376971516424306"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1727554261633187840", "name": "号角", "username": "ai_horn1"}, {"id": "1957843228842946566", "name": "太初学社", "username": "lawson_ste3476"}, {"id": "2114733813662142464", "name": "格 Boss", "username": "maiai_fun"}, {"id": "1751541757370843136", "name": "Ethan Wang", "username": "ethanwang_ai"}, {"id": "1992573103734652928", "name": "老王实验室", "username": "sahuaja3669"}, {"id": "3122661542", "name": "Yangyi", "username": "yangyi"}, {"id": "1988851885118484480", "name": "太阳", "username": "taiyanghere"}, {"id": "26780664", "name": "Rockeymen", "username": "rockeymen"}, {"id": "1572276696014782464", "name": "Joe.Y", "username": "JY960516"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118480670486122803", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxh3znw9z90wtzio8ict99xo59", "oldest_id": "2118376971516424306", "result_count": 9}}